---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Prose from '../components/ui/Prose.tsx';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Practical Information"
  eyebrow="Before you arrive"
  lede="The small details that make your visit smoother — printing, payments, weather, and contacts."
  crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Practical Info' }]}
>
  <Prose>
    <h2>On-site poster printing</h2>
    <p>
      A partner shop near campus offers same-day A0 printing. Place your order at least 24 hours in
      advance. Closed on Sundays and German public holidays.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Dresden Print Werkstatt</strong> · Münchner Platz 3, 01187 Dresden ·
      Mon–Fri, 09:00–17:30.
    </p>
    <h2>Money & payments</h2>
    <p>
      The currency is the euro (€). Card payment is widely accepted, but carry some cash for small
      shops, markets, and trams.
    </p>
    <h2>Weather</h2>
    <p>
      Mid-June in Dresden is typically warm (18–25&nbsp;°C) with occasional showers. Bring a light
      layer for the evenings and the excursion.
    </p>
    <h2>Wi-Fi</h2>
    <p>
      Eduroam is available across the TU Dresden campus. A guest network will also be provided for
      attendees without eduroam access.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      General enquiries: <a href="mailto:netsci@tu-dresden.de">netsci@tu-dresden.de</a>.
      On-site, visit the info desk in the HSZ foyer.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</PageLayout>
